- **Time**: **616 s (~10 m 16 s)** for 100 questions — ~6.2 s per question. **~10× slower than Normain** (60 s). Slightly slower than Cowork (530 s); much slower than NotebookLM (~30 s on UC01).

## Notes on NotebookLM's run (complete — 100/100 graded)

- **Headline: 59 ✅ / 35 ⚠️ / 6 ❌. Traps 4/5. Pairs 5/5. Zero fabrications.** Worst UC08 score so far, despite NotebookLM being NotebookLM's strongest UC01 performer (14/15 = 93%).
